  I myself am interested in Ularn.  If someone could post an ftp site,
I would be most grateful.
 
  Also, about getting past level 15 in PC Rogue, there is not
set answer to your problem, but here are a few suggestions:
 
  1) Get a ring of slow digestion : The best, but hardest to implement.
       This takes luck, and no amount of skill will help you, but
       remember to always identify rings first (before ANYTHING else)
  2) Never wear a ring unless you absolutely, positively must.  Running
       around with a +1 ring of protection is a complete waste.  The
       extra food you consume because of wearing a ring far, far
       outways the bonus protection.
  3) Never put on an un-identified ring unless you have a remove curse
       scroll.  A cursed ring can't be removed, so you may loose your
       food even faster (ring of hunger).  
  4) Lastly (and easiest) never waste a key-stroke.  Instead of 
       walking in a straight line in a room, go diagnal up and
       down.  You cover more area this way, and you won't get fried
       (frozen) by Dragons and such.
 
  Well, I have spoke my peace.  Now, can someone get me ULARN?
 
  


